⚡️🇬🇧 Troops from D Company, 2nd Battalion, Royal Anglian Regiment have been evaluating the L351A1, the British Army's designation for the Mossberg 590M, as part of ongoing counter-UAS experimentation.

The 590M's box magazine-fed design provides enhanced capacity and faster magazine changes compared to traditional tube-fed shotguns, practical advantages in scenarios requiring sustained engagement.

